  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Humanitarian Response Fund (HRF) and UN Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs(OCHA) in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve humanitarian leadership, partnership and coordination of clusters and donors by providing multi-year and flexible funding through the Humanitarian Response Fund, humanitarian pooled fund.  This will save lives, alleviate suffering and reduce disaster risk among millions of vulnerable and disaster affected people across the country. This contributes towards our MDG&#x2019;S by providing timely, targeted, well-coordinated and cost-effective funding in response to humanitarian emergencies and will result in a reduction of the severe malnutrition caseloads from 1,067,000 in 2013 to 848,000 by 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
